WEBVTT

00:00:12.680 --> 00:00:14.580
No luck, Sir!

00:00:15.870 --> 00:00:17.870
Hot springs! Hot springs!

00:00:18.520 --> 00:00:20.370
You can win a hot spring?

00:00:20.820 --> 00:00:22.110
<i>If</i> we win.

00:00:24.070 --> 00:00:27.380
But I'm really hoping for the third place prize instead.

00:00:29.630 --> 00:00:32.650
Hot springs! Hot springs! Hot springs!

00:00:32.650 --> 00:00:35.580
Noel, do you like hot springs that much?

00:00:37.330 --> 00:00:38.890
What's a "hot spring?"

00:00:39.190 --> 00:00:39.740
Eh?

00:00:40.710 --> 00:00:42.370
Um...

00:00:42.370 --> 00:00:46.070
I guess it's like a big bath everyone gets in together...

00:00:48.570 --> 00:00:51.670
Is it bigger than the bath at your house, Nonoka?

00:00:51.670 --> 00:00:52.680
Yup!

00:00:52.680 --> 00:00:54.830
Bigger than the lake?

00:00:54.830 --> 00:00:56.740
N-No, not that big.

00:00:58.370 --> 00:00:58.950
Here you go.

00:00:59.830 --> 00:01:02.480
If you win, you can see for yourself.

00:01:02.480 --> 00:01:03.600
Wanna have a go?

00:01:05.580 --> 00:01:06.340
Okay!

00:01:07.130 --> 00:01:11.510
Hot springs, hot springs, hot springs, hot springs!

00:01:11.510 --> 00:01:12.340
Go!

00:01:19.440 --> 00:01:21.620
Congratulations!

00:01:21.620 --> 00:01:23.060
No way...

00:03:00.420 --> 00:03:01.920
Come on, cheer up.

00:03:01.920 --> 00:03:04.800
Don't you think it's adorable?

00:03:06.050 --> 00:03:07.640
This isn't what I wanted...

00:03:09.600 --> 00:03:11.180
Congratulations!

00:03:11.520 --> 00:03:13.770
You've won first place!

00:03:14.310 --> 00:03:15.730
I don't even want it.

00:03:17.150 --> 00:03:18.730
What am I supposed to do now?

00:03:19.940 --> 00:03:21.820
Thank you very much!

00:07:02.120 --> 00:07:03.410
What?

00:07:04.920 --> 00:07:07.670
I see... So Noel's out.

00:07:07.960 --> 00:07:09.880
You can still come though, right?

00:07:11.380 --> 00:07:12.880
Oh, that's good.

00:07:12.880 --> 00:07:15.680
I'll talk to Koharu about what we should do about the leftover coupon.

00:07:16.220 --> 00:07:18.680
Maybe there's someone else we can invite.

00:07:18.680 --> 00:07:21.010
I'm totally okay with just the three of us though.

00:07:21.520 --> 00:07:22.180
Yeah.

00:07:22.180 --> 00:07:24.890
Oh? There's one left over?

00:07:34.780 --> 00:07:36.740
I bet she's too busy right now.

00:07:40.950 --> 00:07:43.370
Oh, what's up, Koharu?

00:07:43.370 --> 00:07:46.250
Hm? Next weekend?

00:07:46.250 --> 00:07:48.880
Yeah, I'm free.

00:07:53.130 --> 00:07:56.760
There's leftover curry in the fridge. Heat it up before you eat it, okay?

00:07:57.090 --> 00:07:59.760
Make sure you set it to a low flame so it doesn't burn.

00:08:00.050 --> 00:08:02.720
I know how to cook it too, y'know.

00:08:02.720 --> 00:08:03.680
I know, but still!

00:08:03.680 --> 00:08:05.060
And you have to eat salad too!

00:08:05.480 --> 00:08:08.060
You're too picky with your food, Dad.

00:08:08.060 --> 00:08:10.110
All right, sure thing.

00:08:10.110 --> 00:08:13.570
Also, don't just leave your plates lying around after you're done!

00:08:14.070 --> 00:08:15.940
It's a real pain to wash them after they've sat.

00:08:15.940 --> 00:08:17.320
Shouldn't you be leaving soon?

00:08:17.320 --> 00:08:19.570
Whoa, it's already so late?

00:08:20.950 --> 00:08:22.450
I'm leaving!

00:08:23.120 --> 00:08:24.580
Take care!

00:08:36.720 --> 00:08:38.590
<i>I'll tell her today.</i>

00:08:39.300 --> 00:08:40.840
<i>I have to be ready!</i>

00:08:40.840 --> 00:08:42.470
Sorry I'm late!

00:08:42.930 --> 00:08:44.890
Wh-What took you?

00:08:44.890 --> 00:08:45.970
Sorry!

00:08:45.970 --> 00:08:48.730
I was worried about my dad being by himself.

00:08:49.060 --> 00:08:50.150
Where's Koharu?

00:08:50.150 --> 00:08:52.520
She'll be here soon, I guess?

00:08:52.520 --> 00:08:54.020
That's good to hear.

00:08:54.020 --> 00:08:55.780
Looks like I got here earlier than I expected.

00:08:57.070 --> 00:08:58.240
What's wrong?

00:09:01.570 --> 00:09:05.620
Th-There's something that I want to say to you, Nonoka!

00:09:07.790 --> 00:09:09.160
U-Um...

00:09:17.050 --> 00:09:19.130
Sorry I'm late!

00:09:19.470 --> 00:09:20.260
You're early!

00:09:20.260 --> 00:09:21.300
Huh?

00:09:21.300 --> 00:09:23.680
I don't think I'm early at all.

00:09:23.680 --> 00:09:25.140
You should have just taken your time!

00:09:26.140 --> 00:09:27.930
S-Sorry.

00:09:27.930 --> 00:09:30.350
I'll be try to come even later next time...

00:09:30.350 --> 00:09:31.850
O-Oh yeah!

00:09:31.850 --> 00:09:34.480
Is your store going to be okay with you gone?

00:09:34.480 --> 00:09:35.900
You don't need to worry about that.

00:09:36.320 --> 00:09:38.190
I've got it covered.

00:09:42.950 --> 00:09:45.160
All right, then! Shall we?

00:09:52.080 --> 00:09:54.210
They sell them here, too.

00:09:54.500 --> 00:09:55.590
Wow...

00:09:55.590 --> 00:09:57.590
You see them everywhere you go.

00:09:57.590 --> 00:09:58.880
R-Right.

00:09:58.880 --> 00:10:01.220
They don't taste that bad,

00:10:01.220 --> 00:10:05.010
but the ones we ate when we were kids were definitely much better!

00:10:05.010 --> 00:10:06.890
Excuse me...

00:10:06.890 --> 00:10:08.520
My dear customers...

00:10:09.890 --> 00:10:14.230
Shiihara Store's Disc Buns really do taste the best, though!

00:10:24.570 --> 00:10:25.660
What're you doing?

00:10:27.620 --> 00:10:28.620
Shione!

00:10:35.830 --> 00:10:38.350
Look! They have an open-air bath!

00:10:39.170 --> 00:10:40.790
I can't wait!

00:10:43.000 --> 00:10:44.460
We hope you enjoy your stay.

00:10:48.430 --> 00:10:52.640
Hot springs! Hot springs!

00:10:53.520 --> 00:10:55.640
The view from here ain't bad at all!

00:10:56.430 --> 00:10:59.230
Oh? That doesn't sound like something I'd expect to hear from you.

00:10:59.230 --> 00:11:02.980
Th-That doesn't mean I'm okay with the Disc being there, or anything!

00:11:03.360 --> 00:11:05.610
We're just putting our differences aside for now.

00:11:06.530 --> 00:11:07.900
What?

00:11:08.740 --> 00:11:10.490
Hey, hold on!

00:11:10.950 --> 00:11:13.450
What're you getting comfortable for?

00:11:13.450 --> 00:11:16.160
We shouldn't be just sitting here, drinking tea!

00:11:16.160 --> 00:11:17.710
Like what?

00:11:18.620 --> 00:11:20.170
We're at the hot springs!

00:11:20.170 --> 00:11:21.750
We should be <i>in</i> the hot springs!

00:11:22.040 --> 00:11:23.300
Now?!

00:11:23.300 --> 00:11:24.420
Of course!

00:11:24.420 --> 00:11:25.630
Already?!

00:11:29.260 --> 00:11:31.760
Looks like we got here a bit too early.

00:11:36.770 --> 00:11:40.150
I want... to go in the hot spring!

00:11:45.820 --> 00:11:47.780
Not bad, not bad.

00:11:48.190 --> 00:11:50.110
Yeah, okay, I guess.

00:11:50.110 --> 00:11:53.120
Yuzuki, are you sure you should be here like this?

00:11:54.200 --> 00:11:56.540
You have something you need to tell Nonoka, don't you?

00:11:57.580 --> 00:12:01.000
I'm going to go back to our room, so good luck, okay?

00:12:01.000 --> 00:12:04.340
Yeah... I know.

00:12:07.210 --> 00:12:08.840
Hey, Nonoka...

00:12:08.840 --> 00:12:10.760
There's something I want to talk to you about.

00:12:10.760 --> 00:12:11.930
Gimme a second.

00:12:12.930 --> 00:12:14.050
Koharu?

00:12:14.430 --> 00:12:15.890
Go for it!

00:12:16.260 --> 00:12:18.140
I know!

00:12:23.770 --> 00:12:25.650
You're our new champion!

00:12:25.650 --> 00:12:29.190
Eh... Not bad, I guess.

00:12:29.740 --> 00:12:32.320
So what did you want to talk about?

00:12:32.320 --> 00:12:33.660
Eh? What?

00:12:33.660 --> 00:12:34.620
Talk?

00:12:34.620 --> 00:12:36.580
I-It can wait 'till later.

00:12:36.580 --> 00:12:37.200
It's fine...

00:12:37.200 --> 00:12:39.200
You're our new champion!

00:12:39.200 --> 00:12:40.250
Oh?

00:12:43.710 --> 00:12:46.090
Oh, the notice fell off.

00:12:46.090 --> 00:12:47.710
Noel wants to try this one!

00:16:03.370 --> 00:16:04.830
Let's eat them together!

00:16:07.250 --> 00:16:09.540
Shione, do you like the Disc?

00:16:10.710 --> 00:16:12.710
Why do you ask?

00:16:12.710 --> 00:16:15.130
Because you're always taking photos of it!

00:16:15.130 --> 00:16:16.960
I take photos of it...

00:16:17.800 --> 00:16:19.470
to learn more about it.

00:16:21.300 --> 00:16:22.430
We're eating them, right?

00:16:23.510 --> 00:16:25.100
I'll make us some tea.

00:16:42.070 --> 00:16:43.160
Yuzuki!

00:16:46.330 --> 00:16:48.080
What was that for?

00:16:48.370 --> 00:16:51.290
Oh, so it <i>was</i> you, Yuzuki.

00:16:51.290 --> 00:16:52.170
Huh?

00:16:52.750 --> 00:16:55.540
I couldn't see you properly without my glasses.

00:16:55.540 --> 00:16:58.050
What would you have done if it wasn't me?

00:16:58.050 --> 00:16:59.840
So, how did it go?

00:17:00.800 --> 00:17:01.800
Well...

00:17:04.510 --> 00:17:07.140
I'm so happy you invited me to this.

00:17:09.770 --> 00:17:11.060
Thank you, girls.

00:17:13.480 --> 00:17:15.190
You're very welcome.

00:17:18.570 --> 00:17:22.490
Next time, hopefully Noel and Togawa-san can come too.

00:17:22.490 --> 00:17:23.910
I hope so too.

00:17:27.490 --> 00:17:29.410
That was so refreshing!

00:17:30.240 --> 00:17:31.660
Let's go get some cold drinks!

00:17:31.660 --> 00:17:32.960
That sounds great!

00:17:33.540 --> 00:17:34.920
Woohoo!

00:17:34.920 --> 00:17:36.710
Take it all off!

00:17:38.170 --> 00:17:40.300
All of this is a bath?

00:17:40.300 --> 00:17:41.760
Yes, of course.

00:17:41.760 --> 00:17:43.220
Let's get in!

00:17:43.220 --> 00:17:44.840
Hurry up! Hurry up!

00:17:48.430 --> 00:17:49.850
All right.

00:17:54.390 --> 00:17:56.770
It's so fun together!

00:17:57.400 --> 00:17:59.110
A bath is just a bath.

00:18:00.440 --> 00:18:03.490
That won't change no matter how many people join you.

00:18:04.900 --> 00:18:06.610
Warm and relaxing!

00:18:12.500 --> 00:18:14.250
Are you texting Souta?

00:18:14.250 --> 00:18:15.330
Yup.

00:18:15.330 --> 00:18:18.880
I'm thanking him for covering for me at the store.

00:18:18.880 --> 00:18:20.040
That's all?

00:18:20.040 --> 00:18:20.750
Yes, why?

00:18:21.090 --> 00:18:23.130
Nothing like, "I wish you were here too?"

00:18:23.130 --> 00:18:24.220
Why?

00:18:26.630 --> 00:18:29.800
Nonoka, do you have your eyes on anyone?

00:18:29.800 --> 00:18:30.890
Like who?

00:18:33.140 --> 00:18:35.390
Man, you guys are boring.

00:18:35.390 --> 00:18:36.640
Let's just go to bed.

00:18:42.780 --> 00:18:44.150
Yummy...

00:18:47.410 --> 00:18:51.160
When was the last time I wasn't all by myself?

00:19:02.210 --> 00:19:03.550
Are you still awake?

00:19:05.920 --> 00:19:06.920
Yeah.

00:19:07.470 --> 00:19:10.470
Nonoka, thanks.

00:19:22.360 --> 00:19:24.480
"Thanks..."

00:19:33.330 --> 00:19:34.620
Sorry for the wait!

00:19:34.620 --> 00:19:37.370
You could have just bought that from our store back home.

00:19:37.710 --> 00:19:39.040
A souvenir?

00:19:39.040 --> 00:19:39.830
Yup!

00:19:39.830 --> 00:19:41.250
It's for my dad

00:19:41.250 --> 00:19:43.250
and... for my mom.

00:19:43.250 --> 00:19:45.250
What a doting daughter.

00:19:45.250 --> 00:19:46.420
You think so?

00:19:46.420 --> 00:19:47.630
Oh yeah!

00:19:47.630 --> 00:19:50.590
Can we come hang out at your house sometime?

00:19:50.590 --> 00:19:52.140
Of course, anytime!

00:19:53.640 --> 00:19:55.640
The hot spring was so big!

00:19:56.430 --> 00:19:58.100
It wasn't anything special to be honest.

00:19:58.100 --> 00:20:00.140
Noel had so much fun!

00:20:00.140 --> 00:20:01.400
Did you now?

00:20:01.400 --> 00:20:03.270
It's because she was with her friend!

00:20:04.320 --> 00:20:05.900
"Friend?"

00:20:06.530 --> 00:20:09.150
Noel and Shione are friends, right?

00:20:11.860 --> 00:20:13.160
Don't go and decide that for yourself.

00:20:13.700 --> 00:20:16.910
I don't intend to make any friends ever again—

00:20:16.910 --> 00:20:18.330
Oh yeah!

00:20:18.330 --> 00:20:20.210
You like the Disc, right?

00:20:20.210 --> 00:20:21.420
This is for you!

00:20:23.040 --> 00:20:26.420
I'm not going to walk around holding <i>that.</i>

00:20:46.940 --> 00:20:48.730
What a nuisance...

00:20:52.780 --> 00:20:54.280
"Curry soup?"

00:20:54.660 --> 00:20:55.910
I went and tried cooking it.

00:20:55.910 --> 00:20:56.870
Have a taste.

00:20:56.870 --> 00:21:00.040
It might be a better idea to finish off the leftovers first...

00:21:05.880 --> 00:21:08.130
You don't have to get so mad.

00:21:08.500 --> 00:21:11.510
I've told you time after time not to let it burn!

00:21:12.680 --> 00:21:14.140
I'm sorry about that.

00:21:15.340 --> 00:21:16.510
That's Mom's picture!

00:21:17.180 --> 00:21:17.970
Yeah.

00:21:18.560 --> 00:21:22.770
I thought it might look nicer out here than in my room.

00:21:33.860 --> 00:21:35.700
Hey, Dad.

00:21:37.580 --> 00:21:40.080
Can you do me a favor?

00:21:56.890 --> 00:21:59.180
So warm and relaxing...

00:23:32.020 --> 00:23:33.690
Next time, on Sora no Method:

00:23:34.190 --> 00:23:35.690
"What I Once Lost."

00:23:35.690 --> 00:23:37.110
Look forward to it!
